      "classMechanic_text": "<h1>FORMATION</h1><p></p><h3 data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"308\">BUILDING FOCUS</h3><p data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"462\">When wielding a Ranged Firearm, a Sniper gradually builds up Focus—a special resource that represents heightened awareness and concentration on a target.</p><p data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"778\">You begin tracking Focus once you acquire the <strong data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"528\">【Sniper Focus】</strong> skill. At the end of your turn, if you did <strong data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"579\">not</strong> perform a damaging action, you gain 1 Focus. If you are <strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"648\">【Hidden】</strong>, you gain 1 Focus regardless of your actions. You can accumulate Focus up to a maximum equal to your level in <strong data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"777\">【Sniper Focus】</strong>.</p><p></p><h3 data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"800\">SPENDING FOCUS</h3><p data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"921\">Focus can be spent to enhance your precision or unleash powerful attacks. When you make an attack with a Ranged Firearm:</p><ul data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1065\"><li data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"981\"><p data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"981\">You gain <strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"959\">+1 Accuracy per Focus</strong> (via <strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"979\">【Take Aim】</strong>).</p></li><li data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1065\"><p data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1065\">You may <strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1019\">spend all of your Focus</strong> to deal <strong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1064\">+10 bonus damage per Focus spent</strong>.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1254\">Some skills, such as <strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1109\">【Perfect Sniping】</strong>, allow you to spend a single Focus to apply additional effects, such as <strong data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1192\">Homing</strong>, or allow your shot to bypass <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.DMaL1B3Z5Y5AUrvC\" data-id=\"DMaL1B3Z5Y5AUrvC\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Hidden</span></strong></a></span></span> and <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.yE84jvVXyebDulAP\" data-id=\"yE84jvVXyebDulAP\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Isolate</span></strong></a></span></span>.</p><p></p><h3 data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1278\">FOCUS MANAGEMENT</h3><p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1471\">Building Focus requires patience and careful timing. If you engage too early, you may lose the opportunity to deal maximum damage. On the other hand, waiting too long may leave you vulnerable.</p><p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1596\">You may gain Focus even in the midst of combat by coordinating with <strong data-start=\"1541\" data-end=\"1557\">【Camouflage】</strong> or by delaying your offensive actions.</p>",
